{"id":"versichern","lemma":"versichern","pos":"verb","rank":2566,"glosses":["to insure (to provide for compensation if some specified risk occurs)","[with dative ‘someone’ and accusative ‘about something’]","[with genitive ‘about something’ or dass (+ clause) ‘that ...’]"],"ipa":"/ferˈzɪçərn/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/92/De-versichern.ogg/De-versichern.ogg.mp3","conjugation":{"indicative":{"present":{"1s":"versichre","1p":"versichern","2s":"versicherst","2p":"versichert","3s":"versichert","3p":"versichern"},"preterite":{"1s":"versicherte","1p":"versicherten","2s":"versichertest","2p":"versichertet","3s":"versicherte","3p":"versicherten"},"perfect":{"1s":"habe versichert","1p":"haben versichert","2s":"hast versichert","2p":"habt versichert","3s":"hat versichert","3p":"haben versichert"},"future":{"1s":"werde versichern","1p":"werden versichern","2s":"wirst versichern","2p":"werdet versichern","3s":"wird versichern","3p":"werden versichern"}},"imperative":{"affirmative":{"2s":"versichre","2p":"versichert"}},"subjunctive":{"conditional":{"1s":"würde versichern","1p":"würden versichern","2s":"würdest versichern","2p":"würdet versichern","3s":"würde versichern","3p":"würden versichern"}}},"nonFinite":{"participle":"versichert"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich würde dies bitte gern versichern.","en":"I'd like to insure this, please.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"dignity"},null,{"g":"please"},{"g":"willingly"},null]},{"text":"Er versicherte sein neues Haus gegen Feuer.","en":"He insured his new house against fire.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},null,{"g":"to be"},{"g":"new","l":"neu"},{"g":"house, building"},{"g":"against"},{"g":"fire"}]},{"text":"Warum ist es so wichtig, sich zu versichern?","en":"Why is insurance so important?","words":[{"g":"why"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"so"},{"g":"important"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to / too"},null]},{"text":"Ich kann dir versichern, dass das nicht stimmt.","en":"I can assure you that's not true